'''As Above, So Below''' (天地の怒り, ''Tenchi no Ikari'', '''Fury of the Heavens and Earth''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Weaken" Effect UP (Sm): Weaken duration increases by 10%.

